# Citation metadata for HERMESS (Citation File Format, https://citation-file-format.github.io/)
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use HERMESS in your work, please cite the software release in the
  ETH Zurich Research Collection (authors, title, DOI below) and the paper
  describing the underlying PowerDynamicEstimator models (preferred-citation).
type: software
title: "HERMESS: Hybrid EMT/RMS Modern Electric power System Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Time-domain dynamic simulator for power systems modeled by nonlinear
  differential-algebraic equations (DAEs), with synchronous machine, converter,
  static load and dynamic or quasi-static network models, disturbances and
  small-signal analysis. Simulation-only fork of PowerDynamicEstimator.
version: 1.5.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
